      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "MESSAGE FILTER\n\nFilters out echo messages (messages sent by the bot itself) to prevent infinite loops.\n\nOnly allows genuine user messages to proceed through the workflow.\n\nFetches user profile (first name, last name) from Facebook Graph API.",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 776,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "44a89129-d413-4247-8394-f04e62dd4bcf",
      "name": "Note: Message Filter",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "VERIFICATION HANDLER\n\nFacebook requires webhook verification before activation. This IF node checks:\n- hub.mode = \"subscribe\"\n- hub.verify_token = \"YOUR_VERIFY_TOKEN\"\n\nIf valid, it responds with the challenge token to complete verification.",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 776,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "fd83c6b0-4a8c-4aab-a5af-d5944c4447f4",
      "name": "Note: Verification Handler",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "WEBHOOK ENTRY POINT\n\nThis webhook receives incoming messages from Facebook Messenger. It handles both:\n1. Verification requests (GET) from Facebook\n2. Actual message events (POST) from users\n\nThe webhook URL is registered with Facebook to receive real-time message notifications.",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 488,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b27603fb-07fe-4bc6-bc04-d30ea473ed09",
      "name": "Note: Webhook Entry Point",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2544,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "DATA STORAGE\n\nWhen a phone number is successfully collected, the lead data is saved to:\n\n1. Google Sheets - For easy viewing and manual follow-up\n2. HubSpot CRM - Creates or updates contact with lead status \"NEW\"\n\nStored data includes: Name, Phone Number, Sender ID, Timestamp",
        "height": 516,
        "width": 444,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7e3bd2c6-16f8-4825-a511-0886ce5919bd",
      "name": "Note: Data Storage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3056,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "AI MEMORY & KNOWLEDGE BASE\n\nPostgres Chat Memory: Stores conversation history per user (5 messages window) so the AI can reference previous messages.\n\nSupabase Vector Store: Contains embedded business information from Google Drive document. The AI retrieves relevant facts to answer questions and build credibility.\n\nEmbeddings Google Gemini: Converts text to vector embeddings for semantic search.",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 608,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3eb7d045-c190-45c1-bf2c-4f483f311cfe",
      "name": "Note: AI Memory & Knowledge Base",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "CLIENT MODE MANAGEMENT\n\nLooks up client in Google Sheets to check their mode (AI or MANUAL).\n\n- If client exists and mode = AI → Continue to AI Agent\n- If client exists and mode = MANUAL → Stop workflow\n- If client doesn't exist → Create new client in AI mode\n\nThis allows manual override to disable AI responses for specific users.",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "fe1ff520-83c9-4225-a712-5f54d23c2e8d",
      "name": "Note: Client Mode Management",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "PHONE NUMBER EXTRACTION\n\nExtracts phone number from AI response using regex pattern:\n[PHONE: ########]\n\nIf a valid phone number is found, it proceeds to save the lead data.\n\nThe AI is instructed to output this specific format when it successfully collects a valid Tunisian phone number.",
        "height": 292,
        "width": 492,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1fe96815-15bc-490f-bbb7-4583f8f44a2f",
      "name": "Note: Phone Number Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2544,
        288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "AI CONVERSATION ENGINE\n\nThe AI Agent orchestrates the conversation using:\n- Google Gemini Chat Model for natural language understanding\n- Postgres Chat Memory to maintain conversation history per user\n- Supabase Vector Store for retrieving business information\n\nThe agent's goal: Collect a valid Tunisian phone number (8 digits starting with 2, 4, 5, or 9) using persuasive techniques based on the business's value proposition.",
        "height": 216,
        "width": 608,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "c5b4d242-00d8-4fb5-a0fd-388fd268f48f",
      "name": "Note: AI Conversation Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1920,
        64
      ]
    }
